<h1>Absolute Magnitude Listings</h1>

<i>Absolute Magnitude Science Fiction Adventures</i> is the
magazine formerly known as <i>Harsh Mistress Science Fiction
Adventures</i>.  It is a quarterly semi-prozine issued in 
small-bedsheet format. 

<p>
A one year subscription (4 issues) is currently $14.00. Write to:
<pre>
    Absolute Magnitude
    DNA Publications
    P.O. Box 13
    Greenfield, MA 01302
</pre>
<p>
The anchors below lead to specific issues of Absolute Magnitude; 
they currently list works of fiction and the cover artist.
